    "Working capital normalization is where most deal disputes happen after closing",
    "Debt-like items transfer with the business and are easy to miss",
    "Owner compensation add-backs and non-recurring items are standard adjustments",
    "Non-operating income such as sublease rent is deducted from EBITDA"
